    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "thanks. i was thinking of going with a span of about 16 feet. do you think that 6x12 is enough to keep the deflection within that 1/360 range for the live load? also, i'm a bit worried about any potential knots or internal defects in the timber that might affect the strength. how do i account for those when i'm doing my math?",
